Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:40:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD reviewed-feature completion prompts so users can
 close finished chats

After a clean review, the controller asks the patch-agent session whether the feature is done. Affirmative answers are handled locally and close the terminal chat until a later message or agent line makes follow-up work visible again without spending another backend turn.
