-the reviewer reports no findings, the review chat can be marked done by the user.
+the reviewer reports no findings, the review chat can be marked done by the user. Controller-backed
+frontends also ask the reviewed patch-agent chat whether the feature is done; an affirmative answer
+marks the feature chat done, and any later message to that chat reopens it for follow-up work.
 
